extends template.pug

block content
  .col-md-8
    .mb-5
      a.text-dark.text-decoration-none(href='/the-pomodoro-technique-the-life-changing-time-management-system-francesco-cirillo-book-summary')
        h4.fw-bold.mb-3 The Pomodoro Technique: The Life-Changing Time-Management System by Francesco Cirillo Book Summary
        p
          | The Pomodoro Technique: The Life-Changing Time-Management System by Francesco Cirillo was a life-changing book for me. I discovered the Pomodoro technique almost a decade ago while studying in university, and since then, I have been consistently using this technique for doing any kind of focused work.
        div.text-decoration-underline read more
    .mb-5
      a.text-dark.text-decoration-none(href='/the-five-pillars-of-getting-things-done')
        h4.fw-bold.mb-3 The Five Pillars of Getting Things Done
        p
          | Getting things done is not about using the right app or buying the right notebook. It’s a philosophy for living your life in a clear and focused manner, that is agnostic to the underlying system that you choose to implement.
        div.text-decoration-underline read more
